        "Description": "&quot;Florida Man&quot; in Miami was a secret lover of Emma Carlisle, A married-in woman to the Carlisle Throne. When she heard Zachary Carslile authorised the contract to kill her father, she poisoned him with the same drug. Head butler Mr Fersnby denied an autopsy and defended Emma, wanting to destroy the Carslile throne. In fear, Madame Carlisle has authorised a contract on them both, with the drug our agents captured from miami, potent.\rAs always, Good luck 47.\r\rMelee4nopoison\rnotitleonlast\r\rShkerrrr-",
